    {
      "cn_text": "在十七世纪和十八世纪初的一百年间,一股移民浪潮——历史上最伟大的民族迁徙之一——从欧洲涌向美洲。",
      "en_text": "Within the span of a hundred years, in the seventeenth and early eighteenth centuries, a tide of emigration — one of the great folk wanderings of history — swept from Europe to America.",
