    {
      "cn_text": "这场运动由强大而多样的动机驱动,从荒野中建立起一个国家,并因其本质特性,塑造了一块未知大陆的性格和命运。",
      "en_text": "This movement, driven by powerful and diverse motivations, built a nation out of a wilderness and, by its nature, shaped the character and destiny of an uncharted continent.",
