    {
      "cn_text": "但美国特有的地理条件的影响、各民族群体之间的相互作用,以及在这块原始的新大陆上维持旧世界生活方式的巨大困难,导致了显著的变化。",
      "en_text": "But the force of geographic conditions peculiar to America, the interplay of the varied national groups upon one another, and the sheer difficulty of maintaining old-world ways in a raw, new continent caused significant changes.",
